Built; only stub callers}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clpadfl3\clpadl28\clpadft3\clpadt28\clpadfb3\clpadb28\clpadfr3\clpadr28\clvertalc\cellx3076\clpadfl3\clpadl28\clpadft3\clpadt28\clpadfb3\clpadb28\clpadfr3\clpadr28\clvertalc\cellx7193\clpadfl3\clpadl28\clpadft3\clpadt28\clpadfb3\clpadb28\clpadfr3\clpadr28\clvertalc\cellx9972\pard\plain \s24\noline\intbl\ql\noline\ltrpar{\loch
Tree traversal (DFS visitor)}\cell\pard\plain \s24\noline\intbl\ql\noline\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
bsg_view_traverse}{\loch
