 on }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
dbip}{\loch
's mater chain version counter; the sensor recomputes color at next traversal. }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
dl_color_soltab}{\loch
 deletes; }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
color_soltab}{\loch
 (the per-solid helper) becomes the sensor's update function.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
