remember to remove it on cleanup. }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{\loch
In an Inventor/Obol world an overlay is just a child of an "overlay group" node off the scene root \u8212\'97 it is not a database object at all. Concretely: introduce a top-level }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
