\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af8\dbch\af10\afs28\ab\ilvl2\outlinelevel2\sb140\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs28\b\ql\ltrpar{\loch
Layer C \u8212\'97 Lift the redesigned drawing features cleanly into libbsg}
