\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af8\dbch\af10\afs36\ab\ilvl1\outlinelevel1\sb200\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\ltrpar{\loch
4. User-facing redesigns this requires}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
The problem statement explicitly permits redesigning user-facing features. Two are necessary:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
R1. }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
Pseudo-solid overlays stop appearing in }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
who}{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
/}{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
l}{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
/database-name queries}{\loch
. Today }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
vdraw}{\loch
, }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
plot}{\loch
, }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
rt overlay}{\loch
, }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
gdiff}{\loch
 results show up in }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
who}{\loch
 because they live in the display list under }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
RT_DIR_PHONY_ADDR}{\loch
 directory entries. After B6, overlays are not database objects, so }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
who}{\loch
 only reports real drawn database paths. A new command (or a }{\rtlch \ltrch\cs15\dbch\af9\dbch\af5\loch\f5\loch
